<title>POLAND: Kompap Q1 net rises to PLN 1.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Kompap Q1 net rises to PLN 1.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kompap preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 2.07 vs	0.74</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   2.03 vs	0.65</p>
<p>    net profit				 1.32 vs	0.45</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Kompap SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 16.58 vs     11.36</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  12.80 vs	9.60</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.71 vs	0.20</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.83 vs	0.01</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.88 vs	0.10</p>
<p>    investment				 3.07 vs	1.58</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
